Subject: [PATCH 170/572] feat(stm32mp25-fdts): add iwdg1 on eval board

Enable iwdg1 on board file.
Specify the timeout even if the driver ignores it and uses the
reset values already present in the watchdog registers.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 064fb4704ab46964d5d727e9df50802be8869b75 feat(stm32mp25-fdts): add iwdg1 on eval board]
